hud.panels.markdownDescription:
Per-panel settings, keyed by panel id — the same object DeepSeek Harness keeps under `panels:` in the plugin config, so a block can be copied between the two verbatim. Known ids: `quota`, `github`, `todo`, `weather`, `parcel`, `market`, `futures`, `bond`, `sql`.

Example:
```json
{
  "quota": { "pollMs": 60000, "apiKeyEnv": "OPENCODE_GO_API_KEY" },
  "github": { "perRepoLimit": 30 },
  "sql": { "timeoutMs": 15000 }
}
```

Every panel reads its slice on each poll, so an edit applies within one refresh. Values the card itself lets you change (a SQL connection, the market watch list) live in the panel's own storage under `$DSH_HOME/storages/`, and win over this block — exactly as in DSH. See the bundled `hud/README.md` for every field.
